{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">LIST-SET-ATTRS function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309968","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/LIST-SET-ATTRS-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/LIST-SET-ATTRS-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"LIST-SET-ATTRS-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">LIST-SET-ATTRS function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"LIST-SET-ATTRS-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns a comma-separated list of attributes\nthat can be set for an object or widget.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"LIST-SET-ATTRS-function__syntax_GC18UE2696145\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d37969e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"LIST-SET-ATTRS-function__idGDM2LF2672348\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>LIST-SET-ATTRS ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A handle to a valid object or widget. The function returns a\nlist of the attributes that can be set for that object or widget.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"LIST-SET-ATTRS-function__example_GC18UF2696151\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d37969e140\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">For\nan example of the LIST-SET-ATTRS function, see the <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LIST-QUERY-ATTRS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LIST-QUERY-ATTRS-function.html\">LIST-QUERY-ATTRS function</a> reference entry.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"LIST-SET-ATTRS-function__note_GC18UG2696157\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d37969e153\">Note</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">When used\nwith the SECURITY-POLICY handle, this function does not return the\nXCODE-SESSION-KEY writeable attribute because this attribute contains\nan encryption key for encrypted source code.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"LIST-SET-ATTRS-function__see-also_GC18UH2696161\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d37969e162\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CAN-QUERY-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CAN-QUERY-function.html\">CAN-QUERY function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CAN-SET-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CAN-SET-function.html\">CAN-SET function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LAST-EVENT-system-handle.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LAST-EVENT-system-handle.html\">LAST-EVENT system handle</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LIST-EVENTS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LIST-EVENTS-function.html\">LIST-EVENTS function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LIST-QUERY-ATTRS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LIST-QUERY-ATTRS-function.html\">LIST-QUERY-ATTRS function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LIST-WIDGETS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LIST-WIDGETS-function.html\">LIST-WIDGETS function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"VALID-EVENT-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/VALID-EVENT-function.html\">VALID-EVENT function</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LIST-QUERY-ATTRS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LIST-QUERY-ATTRS-function.html\">LIST-QUERY-ATTRS function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LIST-WIDGETS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LIST-WIDGETS-function.html\">LIST-WIDGETS function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309968","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"LIST-SET-ATTRS function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LIST-SET-ATTRS-function.html","type":"Manual"}